-- Generated directly as INSERT statements (from the raw CSVs) rather than via SQLite's .import,
-- specifically to sidestep the .import blank-cell gotcha: .import loads a blank CSV cell as an
-- empty string, not SQL NULL, which would silently break Report (b) in reports.sql (COUNT(rating)
-- would count empty strings as present). Writing NULL explicitly for blank discount_pct/rating
-- cells here means no separate UPDATE ... WHERE col = '' cleanup step is needed.
-- Re-runnable: re-executing this file against a freshly created schema reproduces the same 45/16/180 rows.

